="0"><zone h="100000" id="2" param="vert" type-v2="layout-flow" w="100000" x="0" y="0"><zone h="6000" id="3" type-v2="text" w="100000" x="0" y="0"><formatted-text><run fontsize="18" bold="true">KPI Trust Ledger</run><run fontsize="9">
Lone Star Care Operations (fictional) · three systems report the same appeals process and none of them agree. Backlog is 423, 611, 509 or 211 depending on which extract you open. This page reconciles 6 KPIs across 3 sources and certifies only the ones that survive the test — 2 of 6.</run></formatted-text></zone><zone h="15666" id="4" name="How many sources agree, per KPI" w="100000" x="0" y="6000" /><zone h="15666" id="5" name="One question, four answers" w="100000" x="0" y="21666" /><zone h="15666" id="6" name="Reconciliation rate by source" w="100000" x="0" y="37332" /><zone h="15666" id="7" name="Largest variances" w="100000" x="0" y="52998" /><zone h="15666" id="8" name="Row counts by source" w="100000" x="0" y="68664" /><zone h="15666" id="9" name="Exceptions by severity" w="100000" x="0" y="84330" /></zone></zone></zones></dashboard></dashboards></workbook>